  Provenance: 'Designer retest 2026-11-18 (seed 104729): the yaw 107.8 opening framed the
    base.player anchor (949, 345), but the live Barracks stands at cell (1001, 303) (Unity
    log, Barracks hit by the Battle Tank from cell (1001, 278)), so the HQ was off the top
    of the frame and a parked fighter filled it. Frames the live player base, the actual
    opening Rifle group and a point 15 m from the base toward supply.expansion.a (1156,
    190), which lies on the road the ambush tank drives in on, inside the HUD-free play
    area. Yaw 65 is the smallest rotation from north-up (5 degree steps) that fits this
    opening and also the alert framing of the base with the tank at its firing cell inside
    the play area logged during the alert (437,241 to 1920,611 at 1920x1080), both at least
    1.5 m under the 40 m mobile height cap at 1920x1080 and 2400x1080 (yaw 60 leaves 0.7 m).
    North-up (yaw 0) fits the opening (37.1 m) but needs 67 m for the alert pair. See
    SkirmishS002CameraRetestTests.'
